4260       proc surveylogistic data=WebSurvey total=Enrollment;
4261       stratum Class;
4262       freq Count;
4263       class Design;
4264       model Rating (order=internal) = design;
4265       weight Weight;
4266       run;

NOTE: PROC SURVEYLOGISTIC is fitting the cumulative logit model. The probabilities modeled are summed over the responses having the lower Ordered Values in the 
      Response Profile table.
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYLOGISTIC printed page 247.

4267       proc surveylogistic data=WebSurvey total=Enrollment;
4268       stratum Class;
4269       freq Count;
4270       class Design;
4271       model Rating (ref='neutral') = Design /link=glogit;
4272       weight Weight;
4273       run;

NOTE: PROC SURVEYLOGISTIC is fitting the generalized logit model. The logits modeled contrast each response category against the reference category 
      (Rating='neutral').
NOTE: Convergence criterion (GCONV=1E-8) satisfied.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE SURVEYLOGISTIC printed page 248.

